        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"3c79ef4f-6d9d-48ce-b3ed-a3d5a2abba61\",\"review_text\":\"It is not able for 1 star also it wants subscription in every another song\"},{\"review_id\":\"d99b1e7f-4aa2-42ef-9116-1bd5e51e576b\",\"review_text\":\"Excellent job\"},{\"review_id\":\"f29e8bfd-7773-4f4e-8863-6d829fc6985f\",\"review_text\":\"I noticed the lyrics section is a bit unmanaged, especially on the 'singles & EP' and 'compilation' section. Instead of the lyrics moving forward as the song progress, it stays stagnant and more often has wrong lyrics. It says, \\\"the lyrics are not sync yet\\\" and I saw that like a year ago and it is still not synced. Also, there is no option where we can sort out the song arrangement list on our \\\"liked\\\" music section. Please, check on this one devs! Have the day ya'll deserve!\"},{\"review_id\":\"804443e7-7a77-49c3-a4ee-4651cb557314\",\"review_text\":\"Ywa di ko ka download 😖\"},{\"review_id\":\"159ab9c6-184d-4c11-902b-10219e66ad03\",\"review_text\":\"Have never had issues until recently. Whenever I open the app it only plays the first song then stops. I have to reopen the app and start a new song in my playlist to refresh it\"},{\"review_id\":\"2b1381a1-1f87-445f-ac9b-c25acc63b106\",\"review_text\":\"amei!!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"272b2213-22a4-440d-9974-7e9f71688c92\",\"review_text\":\"Offline listening great\"},{\"review_id\":\"6e8f511f-9ba0-48ab-b526-7eaa2da71052\",\"review_text\":\"New update is trash\"},{\"review_id\":\"71c191bd-bb1c-42ea-8c2f-27681263f923\",\"review_text\":\"Love this app but could used save to mp3 folders\"},{\"review_id\":\"5702aaa6-1bd6-49f0-bdf5-420690521ca8\",\"review_text\":\"Ware,bicod and 😡😡😡😡\"}]}"
